    "type": "question",
    "label": "19",
    "prompt": "Show that\n$$\\sin^2\\alpha\\cos^2\\beta-\\cos^2\\alpha\\sin^2\\beta=\\cos^2\\beta-\\cos^2\\alpha,$$\nfor any values of $\\alpha$ and $\\beta$.",
